      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使是模拟赛，大家，似乎也都做好了万全准备呢。\n我、我们也要……为了不被吞没，一起加油吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6935102e2817383465d7034a3dbab80f8d88b698c3ca85d1749898d27ce12c76",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
